#: doc/texinfo/api.texi
msgctxt "doc/texinfo/api.texi|Namespace gmsh|paragraph|gmsh/initialize"
msgid "Initialize the Gmsh API. This must be called before any call to the other functions in the API. If @code{argc} and @code{argv} (or just @code{argv} in Python or Julia) are provided, they will be handled in the same way as the command line arguments in the Gmsh app. If @code{readConfigFiles} is set, read system Gmsh configuration files (gmshrc and gmsh-options). If @code{run} is set, run in the same way as the Gmsh app, either interactively or in batch mode depending on the command line arguments. If @code{run} is not set, initializing the API sets the options \"General.AbortOnError\" to 2 and \"General.Terminal\" to 1."
msgstr ""

