msgctxt "doc/texinfo/api.texi|Namespace gmsh/model/mesh|paragraph|gmsh/model/mesh/optimize"
msgid "Optimize the mesh of the current model using @code{method} (empty for default tetrahedral mesh optimizer, \"Netgen\" for Netgen optimizer, \"HighOrder\" for direct high-order mesh optimizer, \"HighOrderElastic\" for high-order elastic smoother, \"HighOrderFastCurving\" for fast curving algorithm, \"Laplace2D\" for Laplace smoothing, \"Relocate2D\" and \"Relocate3D\" for node relocation, \"QuadQuasiStructured\" for quad mesh optimization, \"UntangleMeshGeometry\" for untangling). If @code{force} is set apply the optimization also to discrete entities. If @code{dimTags} (given as a vector of (dim, tag) pairs) is given, only apply the optimizer to the given entities."
