msgid "Clear the mesh, i.e. delete all the nodes and elements, for the entities @code{dimTags}, given as a vector of (dim, tag) pairs. If @code{dimTags} is empty, clear the whole mesh. Note that the mesh of an entity can only be cleared if this entity is not on the boundary of another entity with a non-empty mesh."
msgstr ""

