msgid "Add nodes classified on the model entity of dimension @code{dim} and tag @code{tag}. @code{nodeTags} contains the node tags (their unique, strictly positive identification numbers). @code{coord} is a vector of length 3 times the length of @code{nodeTags} that contains the x, y, z coordinates of the nodes, concatenated: [n1x, n1y, n1z, n2x, ...]. The optional @code{parametricCoord} vector contains the parametric coordinates of the nodes, if any. The length of @code{parametricCoord} can be 0 or @code{dim} times the length of @code{nodeTags}. If the @code{nodeTags} vector is empty, new tags are automatically assigned to the nodes."
