msgid "Set the meshes of the entities of dimension @code{dim} and tag @code{tags} as periodic copies of the meshes of entities @code{tagsMaster}, using the affine transformation specified in @code{affineTransformation} (16 entries of a 4x4 matrix, by row). If used after meshing, generate the periodic node correspondence information assuming the meshes of entities @code{tags} effectively match the meshes of entities @code{tagsMaster} (useful for structured and extruded meshes). Currently only available for @code{dim} == 1 and @code{dim} == 2."
