msgid "Classify (\"color\") the surface mesh based on the angle threshold @code{angle} (in radians), and create new discrete surfaces, curves and points accordingly. If @code{boundary} is set, also create discrete curves on the boundary if the surface is open. If @code{forReparametrization} is set, create curves and surfaces that can be reparametrized using a single map. If @code{curveAngle} is less than Pi, also force curves to be split according to @code{curveAngle}. If @code{exportDiscrete} is set, clear any built-in CAD kernel entities and export the discrete entities in the built-in CAD kernel."
msgstr ""

