msgid "Add a geometrical point in the OpenCASCADE CAD representation, at coordinates (@code{x}, @code{y}, @code{z}). If @code{meshSize} is > 0, add a meshing constraint at that point. If @code{tag} is positive, set the tag explicitly; otherwise a new tag is selected automatically. Return the tag of the point. (Note that the point will be added in the current model only after @code{synchronize} is called. This behavior holds for all the entities added in the occ module.)"
