msgid "Add a spline (C2 b-spline) curve in the OpenCASCADE CAD representation, going through the points @code{pointTags}. If @code{tag} is positive, set the tag explicitly; otherwise a new tag is selected automatically. Create a periodic curve if the first and last points are the same. Return the tag of the spline curve. If the @code{tangents} vector contains 6 entries, use them as concatenated x, y, z components of the initial and final tangents of the b-spline; if it contains 3 times as many entries as the number of points, use them as concatenated x, y, z components of the tangents at each point, unless the norm of the tangent is zero."
