msgctxt "doc/texinfo/api.texi|Namespace gmsh/model/occ|paragraph|gmsh/model/occ/addCurveLoop"
msgid "Add a curve loop (a closed wire) in the OpenCASCADE CAD representation, formed by the curves @code{curveTags}. @code{curveTags} should contain tags of curves forming a closed loop. Negative tags can be specified for compatibility with the built-in kernel, but are simply ignored: the wire is oriented according to the orientation of its first curve. Note that an OpenCASCADE curve loop can be made of curves that share geometrically identical (but topologically different) points. If @code{tag} is positive, set the tag explicitly; otherwise a new tag is selected automatically. Return the tag of the curve loop."
msgstr ""

