msgctxt "doc/texinfo/api.texi|Namespace gmsh/model/occ|paragraph|gmsh/model/occ/addBezierSurface"
msgid "Add a Bezier surface in the OpenCASCADE CAD representation, with @code{pointTags} control points given as a single vector [Pu1v1, ... Pu@code{numPointsU}v1, Pu1v2, ...]. If @code{tag} is positive, set the tag explicitly; otherwise a new tag is selected automatically. If @code{wireTags} is provided, trim the Bezier patch using the provided wires: the first wire defines the external contour, the others define holes. If @code{wire3D} is set, consider wire curves as 3D curves and project them on the Bezier surface; otherwise consider the wire curves as defined in the parametric space of the surface. Return the tag of the Bezier surface."
msgstr ""

