msgctxt "doc/texinfo/api.texi|Namespace gmsh/view|paragraph|gmsh/view/addListData"
msgid "Add list-based post-processing data to the view with tag @code{tag}. List-based datasets are independent from any model and any mesh. @code{dataType} identifies the data by concatenating the field type (\"S\" for scalar, \"V\" for vector, \"T\" for tensor) and the element type (\"P\" for point, \"L\" for line, \"T\" for triangle, \"S\" for tetrahedron, \"I\" for prism, \"H\" for hexaHedron, \"Y\" for pyramid). For example @code{dataType} should be \"ST\" for a scalar field on triangles. @code{numEle} gives the number of elements in the data. @code{data} contains the data for the @code{numEle} elements, concatenated, with node coordinates followed by values per node, repeated for each step: [e1x1, ..., e1xn, e1y1, ..., e1yn, e1z1, ..., e1zn, e1v1..., e1vN, e2x1, ...]."
msgstr ""

