#: doc/texinfo/gmsh.texi
msgctxt "doc/texinfo/gmsh.texi|Other mesh commands|paragraph|Cohomology ( @{ @var{expression-list} @} ) @{ @{ @var{expression-list} @} , @{ @var{expression-list} @} @};"
msgid "Similar to command @code{Homology}, but computes a basis representation\nfor cohomology spaces instead."
