msgid "This chapter describes Gmsh's native ``MSH'' file format, used to store\nmeshes and associated post-processing datasets. The MSH format exists in\ntwo flavors: ASCII and binary. The format has a version number that is\nindependent of Gmsh's main version number."
msgstr ""

#. unit_id: ce879fedc5d12e91cae13e76b9020144b809dbcc4d0b43a569403ecfb7c81d5e
