msgctxt "doc/texinfo/plugins.texi|Top|paragraph|Plugin(BoundaryAngles)"
msgid "Plugin(BoundaryAngles) computes the (interior) angles between the line elements on the boundary of all surfaces. The angles, computed modulo 2*Pi, are stored in a new post-processing view, one for each surface. The plugin currently only works for planar surfaces.Available options:- Visible (1=True, 0 = False, Default = 1): Visibility of the Views in the GUI - Save (1=True, 0 = False, Default = 0): Save the Views on disk ?- Remove (1=True, 0 = False, Default = 0): Remove the View from the memory after execution?- Filename (Default = 'Angles_Surface'): Root name for the Views (in case of save / Visibility)- Dir (Default = ''): Output directory (possibly nested)\nString options:"
msgstr ""

