msgid "3.0.6 (November 5, 2017): improved meshing of spheres; improved handling of mesh\nsize constraints with OpenCASCADE kernel; implemented \"Coherence\" for\nOpenCASCADE kernel (shortcut for BooleanFragments); added GAMBIT Neutral File\nexport; small improvements and bug fixes."
msgstr ""

