msgid "2.11.0 (November 7, 2015): new Else/ElseIf commands; new OptimizeMesh command;\nPlugin(ModifyComponents) replaces Plugin(ModifyComponent); new VTK and X3D\noutputs; separate 0/Ctrl+0 shortcuts for geometry/full model reload; small bug\nfixes in homology solver, handling of embedded entities, and Plugin(Crack)."
msgstr ""

