msgid "1.16 (Feb 26, 2001): added single/double buffer selection (only useful for Unix\nversions of Gmsh run from remote hosts without GLX); fixed a bug for recent\nversions of the opengl32.dll on Windows, which caused OpenGL fonts not to show\nup."
msgstr ""

